Usage: cardano-cli dijkstra sub-transaction sign --sub-tx-file FILEPATH
                                                   [--signing-key-file FILEPATH]
                                                   --out-file FILEPATH
                                                   

  Sign a sub-transaction

Available options:
  --sub-tx-file FILEPATH   Input filepath of the JSON unsigned sub-transaction.
  --signing-key-file FILEPATH
                           Input filepath of the signing key.
  --out-file FILEPATH      Output filepath of the JSON signed sub-transaction.
  -h,--help                Show this help text
